{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026xPSmsX4qq31793245736.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>因應有攝錄功能的智能眼鏡越趨普及，個人資料私隱專員公署已發布相關的使用指引，建議更衣室、醫院等場所不能使用。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.RTHK.GLASSES.BITE-1030.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026bkPj2XaDgI1793245743.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>個人資料私隱專員鍾麗玲說：「它可以是聲控的，根本用者不用脫下眼鏡或按鈕，所以周邊的人可能在不容易察覺到的情況下，被拍照甚至錄影。我們擔心有人士長期使用錄影功能，屬於過度收集資料的情況。譬如更衣室、醫院、診所，我們建議盡量不使用智能眼鏡，而其他人也要提高警覺。有一些廠商的眼鏡是有閃燈，這是一個好的做法，因為攝錄的時候閃燈會亮。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T04:21:27.454313+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":219,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T03:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T11:58:17.568374+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T04:18:16.840606+00:00","content_hash":"b3522df7c6cabae42e504bca95b1fe9b172553162c6cacac854d4f6bfef1187b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T04:21:27.454313+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}